              "symptom": "Yoghurt has curdled into lumps",
              "cause": "Heat too high when the yoghurt was added.",
              "fix": "Always add dairy on the lowest heat and never boil."
            },
            {
              "symptom": "Korma tastes bland",
              "cause": "Onions not cooked long enough at the start.",
